  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Proactive Security and Justice Policies Program in Argentina (PROSEJUS)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Polticas Proactivas en Seguridad y Justicia en Argentina (PROSEJUS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribute to reducing impunity for crimes associated with criminal organizations through the following specific development objectives: (i) increasing the effectiveness of criminal prosecution; (ii) increasing the effectiveness of criminal investigations; and (iii) increasing the effectiveness of criminal asset recovery.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">contribuir a reducir la impunidad de los delitos asociados a organizaciones criminales, a travs de los siguientes objetivos especficos de desarrollo: (i) aumentar la efectividad de la persecucin penal; (ii) aumentar la efectividad de la investigacin criminal; y (iii) aumentar la efectividad en la recuperacin de activos criminales.</narrative>
  </description>
